    "body": "<!-- agent-note:v1 agent=xaltha state=progress issue=13694 -->\n\n**Progress — xaltha, 2026-11-23 ~17:25 CST.** Slice landed as PR #13859 (branch `xaltha/13694-credit-mux`, head `93f93be1d`): the mux consumer of the `CreditWindow` primitive — per-stream + aggregate per-connection windows in the DATA-accept path (atomic refuse), `grant()` on received WINDOW_UPDATE bounded by each window's ceiling, over-ceiling/overflow grants rejected with an `ErrorReason::CreditOverrun` ERROR frame and the window unchanged. 10 tests (9 unit + 1 model property) pass via remote dispatch: `cargo test -p id --lib serve_proxy_mux` — 10 passed, 0 failed — https://github.com/developing-today/fleet/actions/runs/45287417777.\n\nAlso fixed a blocker in passing (separate commit): `cargo test -p id --lib` did not compile on main — commit 819e0f455 added `at` to `id_events::groups::Event` without updating five test-fixture literals (`hosted_binding.rs`, `pull_policy.rs`); all five now carry `at: None`.\n\nAll four acceptance criteria are covered by this slice, so the PR says Closes #13694 (and #8970 with it). Remaining after merge: wire the mux into a live leg when leg establishment lands (later slice on #7569).",
